ring through the rosegarden\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source describes visitors traveling to enjoy the garden, matching the claim's substance.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-009\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"everyone who visited the rosegarden from the outside picked their favorite scenery and tried to draw what they liked most.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source states visitors picked favorite scenery and attempted to draw it.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-010\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"They then sent the postcard to their home.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The Postcards section describes visitors sending postcards to their homes.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-011\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"People were starting to make bets on whether the postcard arrived at their home before they arrived home.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source directly states this betting behavior.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-012\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the people and the postcards were usually transported in the same carriage.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source explains that ties in the race occurred because both traveled together.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-013\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"there was an old lady that lived in a dark, spooky forest.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The opening of source_b.md introduces the old lady living in the forest.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-014\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The forest was not traversable between October and April\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The Seasons section directly states the forest's impassability during this period.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-015\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The old lady nevertheless lived the entire year in the forest.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source explicitly states she inhabited the forest year-round despite seasonal difficulties.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-016\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Over the years, she acclimated to the weather\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source states her acclimation to harsh conditions over time.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-017\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"built strategies to survive the harsh conditions.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The Seasons section describes her development of survival strategies.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-018\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"she collected wild herbs.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The Work section explicitly states she collected wild herbs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-019\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PARTIAL\",\n      \"evidence\": \"who transported and sold the herbs into the cities.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source confirms the travelers transported and sold herbs to cities, but does not explicitly state who sold the herbs to the travelers.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-020\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"one young man took the courage and traveled to the old lady's house deep in the woods.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The Illness section describes a young man's journey to reach the old lady.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-021\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"It took him days to reach her house\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source states the journey required multiple days.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-022\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"he struggled with the wet and slippery ground.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source describes his difficulties with ground conditions during travel.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-023\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"He also lost his orientation several times.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source explicitly states he lost orientation multiple times.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-024\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"eventually, he reached her house.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source states he eventually reached the old lady's house.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-025\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"He carefully knocked\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source describes his careful approach by knocking on the door.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-026\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"When she opened the door and saw the young man, she asked him to come into her house, sit at the fire and drink some hot soup she made for him.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source describes all elements: opening door, seeing the visitor, and inviting him to enter, sit, and have soup.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-027\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n 